author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: Advertised output and producer cursors retrieve every matching ID;Continued focus collections have no duplicated IDs;Delivered counts and hidden status receipts agree with emitted rows;Population and count-only totals remain intact;CLI and SDK filter changes reject cursors and field projection remains compatible
parent: pm-doxj
risk: medium
confidence: high
resolution: "Universal presentation controls no longer alter producer identity; tracker-bound cursors compose across output and producer pages, and delivered counts and serialized focus classifications survive projection/compaction while count-only aggregates remain intact."
expected_result: Advertised cursor chains deliver all matching focus IDs with correct counts; genuine filter/scope changes refuse reuse and population totals remain accurate.
actual_result: "Linked continuation acceptance passed 52 tests, including actual budget cursors, JSON cloning, long semantic receipts and count-only warning compaction. Full corpus passed 9467 with two platform skips and exact all-source coverage. Static/token/context gates passed unchanged ceilings; 329 of 336 mutants killed with seven existing reviewed equivalents and the score floor raised to 97.91666666666667."
